 ## Background
-Volpack was developed by William M. Newman's group at Stanford University. The method is described in the VolPack User's Guide and associated source code [S2]. It was designed to provide efficient volume rendering for medical imaging and scientific visualization, leveraging the sparsity of volumetric data [S1, unofficial][S2]. The RLE classification technique was a key innovation in early volume rendering systems, allowing real-time interaction with large datasets [S2].
